{"dialogue": {"lines": [{"en": "What is the weather today?", "hi": "आज मौसम कैसा है?", "r": "Aaj mausam kaisa hai?", "sp": "Brother", "t": "آج موسم کیسا ہے؟"}, {"en": "It will rain. Take an umbrella.", "hi": "बारिश आएगी। छाता ले लो।", "r": "Barish aayegi. Chhata le lijiye.", "sp": "Sister", "t": "بارش آئے گی۔ چھاتا لے لیجیے۔"}, {"en": "It rained yesterday too.", "hi": "कल भी बारिश हुई।", "r": "Kal bhi barish hui.", "sp": "Brother", "t": "کل بھی بارش ہوئی۔"}, {"en": "Good rain means good crops.", "hi": "अच्छी बारिश मतलब अच्छी फ़सल।", "r": "Achhi barish matlab achhi fasal.", "sp": "Sister", "t": "اچھی بارش مطلب اچھی فصل۔"}, {"en": "Yes! The monsoon is lovely.", "hi": "हाँ! मानसून सुहाना है।", "r": "Haan! Saavan-bhaadon suhana hai.", "sp": "Brother", "t": "ہاں! ساون بھادوں سہانا ہے۔"}], "title": "Rain talk"}, "lede": "Rain, seasons and harvest — Urdu for the skies.", "phrases": [{"en": "It is raining", "hi": "बारिश हो रही है", "r": "Barish ho rahi hai", "t": "بارش ہو رہی ہے"}, {"en": "It is very hot", "hi": "बहुत गर्मी है", "r": "Bahut garmi hai", "t": "بہت گرمی ہے"}, {"en": "It is cold today", "hi": "आज ठंड है", "r": "Aaj thand hai", "t": "آج ٹھنڈ ہے"}, {"en": "What a pleasant wind!", "hi": "कितनी अच्छी हवा!", "r": "Kaisi achhi hava!", "t": "کیسی اچھی ہوا!"}, {"en": "Take an umbrella", "hi": "छाता ले लो", "r": "Chhata le lijiye", "t": "چھاتا لے لیجیے"}, {"en": "The sun rose", "hi": "सूरज निकला", "r": "Suraj nikla", "t": "سورج نکلا"}, {"en": "Night fell", "hi": "रात हो गई", "r": "Raat ho gai", "t": "رات ہو گئی"}, {"en": "Look at the moon!", "hi": "चाँद देखो!", "r": "Chaand dekhiye!", "t": "چاند دیکھیے!"}, {"en": "How beautiful the stars are!", "hi": "तारे कितने सुंदर हैं!", "r": "Sitare kitne khubsurat!", "t": "ستارے کتنے خوبصورت!"}, {"en": "Good morning!", "hi": "सुबह बख़ैर!", "r": "Subah bakhair!", "t": "صبح بخیر!"}, {"en": "Good night!", "hi": "शब बख़ैर!", "r": "Shab bakhair!", "t": "شب بخیر!"}, {"en": "See you in the evening", "hi": "शाम को मिलते हैं", "r": "Shaam 